---
---
<section class="py-24 bg-premium-black">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <p class="text-gold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-xs font-semibold mb-4">
        Trust Signals
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-4">
        Pedigree you can feel from day one.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Seasoned coaching, proven frameworks, and quality control in every session.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      <div class="bg-premium-dark/70 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gold/60 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gold mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold">15+ years refining the method</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Built from thousands of sessions, stress-tested with executives and creators.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-premium-dark/70 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gold/60 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gold mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
          <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold">Certified & evidence-led</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Coaches certified across strength, nutrition, and recovery disciplines.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-premium-dark/70 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gold/60 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gold mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg>
          <span class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold">Proven, not templated</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Every protocol is audited weekly to ensure it stays personal and effective.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

